    {
      "id": "53dd14d212f4-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "The cube of the sum of two given numbers is 1728, while the product of the two given numbers is 32. Find the positive difference between the cubes of the two given numbers. &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2342;&#2379; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327;&#2347;&#2354; &#2325;&#2366; &#2328;&#2344; 1728 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2348;&#2325;&#2367; &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2342;&#2379; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2327;&#2369;&#2339;&#2344;&#2347;&#2354; 32 &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2328;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2325;&#2366; &#2343;&#2344;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2350;&#2325; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The cube of the sum of two given numbers is 1728, while the product of the two given numbers is 32. Find the positive difference between the cubes of the two given numbers.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2342;&#2379; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327;&#2347;&#2354; &#2325;&#2366; &#2328;&#2344; 1728 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2348;&#2325;&#2367; &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2342;&#2379; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2327;&#2369;&#2339;&#2344;&#2347;&#2354; 32 &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2328;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2325;&#2366; &#2343;&#2344;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2350;&#2325; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "448 448",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">448</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">448</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "576 576",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">576</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">576</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "480 480",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">480</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">480</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "512 512",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">512</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">512</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>Let the two number are 'a' and 'b'.</p><p>According to the question:</p><p>(a + b)<sup>3</sup> = 1728 = 12<sup>3</sup></p><p>a + b = 12 ....... (1)</p><p>ab = 32 ...... (2)</p><p>(a  -  b)<sup>2</sup> = (a + b)<sup>2</sup>  -  4ab</p><p>(a  -  b)<sup>2</sup> = 12<sup>2</sup>  -  4 * 32 = 16</p><p>a  -  b = 4</p><p>a = 8 and b = 4</p><p>Required difference = 8<sup>3</sup>  -  4<sup>3</sup> = 512  -  64</p><p>= 448</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "53dd14d212f4-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "Which of the following is a prime number? &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2368; &#2319;&#2325; &#2309;&#2349;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which of the following is a prime number?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2368; &#2319;&#2325; &#2309;&#2349;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "54 54",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">54</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">54</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "39 39",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">39</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">39</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "68 68",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">68</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">68</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "89 89",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">89</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">89</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><b>Prime number:</b> Number which is divisible by only 1 and itself.</p><p>54 = 1 * 2 * 3 * 3 * 3</p><p>39 = 1 * 3 * 13</p><p>68 = 1 * 2 * 2 * 17</p><p>89 = 1 * 89</p><p>Hence, 89 is a prime number.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "53dd14d212f4-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "A number whose fifth part increased by 5 equals to its third part decreased by 7. Find half of the number. &#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2366;&#2305;&#2330;&#2357;&#2366;&#2305; &#2349;&#2366;&#2327; 5 &#2360;&#2375; &#2348;&#2338;&#2364;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2346;&#2352; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2340;&#2368;&#2360;&#2352;&#2366; &#2349;&#2366;&#2327; 7 &#2360;&#2375; &#2328;&#2335; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2310;&#2343;&#2366; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>A number whose fifth part increased by 5 equals to its third part decreased by 7. Find half of the number.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2366;&#2305;&#2330;&#2357;&#2366;&#2305; &#2349;&#2366;&#2327; 5 &#2360;&#2375; &#2348;&#2338;&#2364;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2346;&#2352; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2340;&#2368;&#2360;&#2352;&#2366; &#2349;&#2366;&#2327; 7 &#2360;&#2375; &#2328;&#2335; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2310;&#2343;&#2366; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "45 45",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">45</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">45</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "150 150",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">150</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">150</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "80 80",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">80</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">80</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "60 60",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">60</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">60</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>Let the number = N.</p><p>Equation: N/5 + 5 = N/3  -  7</p><p>Multiply by 15: 3N + 75 = 5N  -  105</p><p>=&gt; 180 = 2N</p><p>=&gt; N = 90</p><p>Half = 90/2 = 45</p><p>Option (a) is the correct answer.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "53dd14d212f4-q4",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "Ramu mixes 2 litres of water at 100&deg;C and 18 litres of water at 32&deg;C. What temperature will the water have after mixing? &#2352;&#2366;&#2350;&#2370; 100&deg;C &#2346;&#2352; 2 &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2346;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368; &#2324;&#2352; 32&deg;C &#2346;&#2352; 18 &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2346;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368; &#2350;&#2367;&#2354;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2350;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2346;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2340;&#2366;&#2346;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Ramu mixes 2 litres of water at 100&deg;C and 18 litres of water at 32&deg;C. What temperature will the water have after mixing?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2352;&#2366;&#2350;&#2370; 100&deg;C &#2346;&#2352; 2 &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2346;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368; &#2324;&#2352; 32&deg;C &#2346;&#2352; 18 &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2346;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368; &#2350;&#2367;&#2354;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2350;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2346;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2340;&#2366;&#2346;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "66&deg;C 66&deg;C",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">66&deg;C</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">66&deg;C</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "20&deg;C 20&deg;C",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">20&deg;C</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">20&deg;C</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "38.8&deg;C 38.8&deg;C",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">38.8&deg;C</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">38.8&deg;C</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "40&deg;C 40&deg;C",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">40&deg;C</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">40&deg;C</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>Final temperature T = (m&#8321; * T&#8321; + m&#8322; * T&#8322;) / (m&#8321; + m&#8322;) </p><p>m&#8321; = 2 L, T&#8321; = 100&deg;C </p><p>m&#8322; = 18 L, T&#8322; = 32&deg;C </p><p>T = (2 * 100 + 18 * 32)/(2 + 18) </p><p>= (200 + 576)/20 </p><p>= 776/20 </p><p>= 38.8&deg;C</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
