      "question": "Find the average of the prime numbers lying between 69 and 92. 69 &#2324;&#2352; 92 &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340; &#2309;&#2349;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2324;&#2360;&#2340; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Find the average of the prime numbers lying between 69 and 92.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>69 &#2324;&#2352; 92 &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340; &#2309;&#2349;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2324;&#2360;&#2340; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
