      "question": "Rajesh, in his printing press, got an order to print some books, out of which he completed 17/27 of the order in 34 days. In how many days, did he complete the entire order of printing? Options: &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2379; &#2309;&#2346;&#2344;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2306;&#2335;&#2367;&#2306;&#2327; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2360; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2369;&#2331; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2366;&#2348;&#2375;&#2306; &#2331;&#2366;&#2346;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2321;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337;&#2352; &#2350;&#2367;&#2354;&#2366;, &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360;&#2344;&#2375; &#2321;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; 17/27 &#2361;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2360;&#2366; 34 &#2342;&#2367;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2404; &#2313;&#2360;&#2344;&#2375; &#2331;&#2346;&#2366;&#2312; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2366; &#2321;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337;&#2352; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2375; &#2342;&#2367;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2366; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;? &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346;:",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Rajesh, in his printing press, got an order to print some books, out of which he completed 17/27 of the order in 34 days. In how many days, did he complete the entire order of printing?</p><p>Options:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2379; &#2309;&#2346;&#2344;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2306;&#2335;&#2367;&#2306;&#2327; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2360; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2369;&#2331; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2366;&#2348;&#2375;&#2306; &#2331;&#2366;&#2346;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2321;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337;&#2352; &#2350;&#2367;&#2354;&#2366;, &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360;&#2344;&#2375; &#2321;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; 17/27 &#2361;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2360;&#2366; 34 &#2342;&#2367;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2404; &#2313;&#2360;&#2344;&#2375; &#2331;&#2346;&#2366;&#2312; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2366; &#2321;&#2352;&#2381;&#2337;&#2352; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2375; &#2342;&#2367;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2366; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;?</p><p>&#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346;:</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "60 60",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">60</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">60</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "20 20",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">20</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">20</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "54 54",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">54</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">54</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "56 56",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">56</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">56</span>"
        }
