      "question": "The cube of the sum of two given numbers is 1728, while the product of the two given numbers is 32. Find the positive difference between the cubes of the two given numbers. &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2342;&#2379; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327;&#2347;&#2354; &#2325;&#2366; &#2328;&#2344; 1728 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2348;&#2325;&#2367; &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2327;&#2369;&#2339;&#2344;&#2347;&#2354; 32 &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2328;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2325;&#2366; &#2343;&#2344;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2350;&#2325; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The cube of the sum of two given numbers is 1728, while the product of the two given numbers is 32. Find the positive difference between the cubes of the two given numbers.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2342;&#2379; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327;&#2347;&#2354; &#2325;&#2366; &#2328;&#2344; 1728 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2348;&#2325;&#2367; &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2327;&#2369;&#2339;&#2344;&#2347;&#2354; 32 &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2328;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2325;&#2366; &#2343;&#2344;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2350;&#2325; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>",
